      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "641C5C0BFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "異次元密阿雷\n還會繼續出現不是嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75706B2151435BC6963F96F7000A908467037E7C7E8C51FA73FE4E0D662F55CEFF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那裡頭似乎還有\n完全未知的異次元密阿雷！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A388E1982D4F3C4E4E90846709000A5B8C5168672A77E5768475706B2151435BC6963F96F7FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用來發現那些未知的\n異次元密阿雷的系統……那就是！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>特殊搜尋<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75284F86767C73FE90A34E9B672A77E57684000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F776847CFB7D712026202690A35C31662FFF0100100001BE01000A00100002FF00000672796B8A641C5C0B00100002FF000000FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說得一副像是我的功勞，\n但這東西是闊星公司開發的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA5F974E00526F50CF662F62117684529F52DEFF0C000A4F4690196771897F662F95CA661F516C53F8958B767C7684300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有了特殊搜尋，\n就能找到通往未知的異次元密阿雷的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n特殊的異次元扭洞了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E8672796B8A641C5C0BFF0C000A5C3180FD627E5230901A5F80672A77E5768475706B2151435BC6963F96F7768400100001BE00000A72796B8A768475706B215143626D6D1E4E86FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，聽說這東西還不算真正完成。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要讓它完美，必須得進行異次元調查！\n就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳努力去解決異次元課題囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C807D8AAA90196771897F90844E0D7B97771F6B635B8C6210300200100001BE01000A89818B935B835B8C7F8EFF0C5FC598085F979032884C75706B2151438ABF67E5FF01000A5C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B352AA529B53BB89E36C7A75706B2151438AB2984C56C9300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了完成特殊搜尋，\n就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳努力去解決異次元課題囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E865B8C621072796B8A641C5C0BFF0C000A5C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B352AA529B53BB89E36C7A75706B2151438AB2984C56C9FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
