      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E795F974E0D932F561BFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在得用特殊搜尋才發現得到的\n異次元密阿雷裡面<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n很有可能會有特別的寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285F97752872796B8A641C5C0B624D767C73FE5F9752307684000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F788E1976200100001BE00000A5F88670953EF80FD670367097279522576845BF653EF5922FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但想用特殊搜尋的話，\n每次都得要重新儲存資料。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4660F3752872796B8A641C5C0B76848A71FF0C000A6BCF6B2190FD5F97898191CD65B051325B588CC76599300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然有點兒麻煩，\n但應該難不倒<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
